[Script Info]Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.709PlayResX: 1440PlayResY: 1080[V4+ Styles]Format: Name, Fontname, Fontsize, PrimaryColour, SecondaryColour, OutlineColour, BackColour, Bold, Italic, Underline, StrikeOut, ScaleX, ScaleY, Spacing, Angle, BorderStyle, Outline, Shadow, Alignment, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, EncodingStyle: Credits-207-,FOT-Greco Std B Strp,50,&H00FFFFFF,&H00002EFF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,95,100,1.6,0,1,3,0,7,16,16,16,1Style: Title-207-,M+ ıc,95,&H00FEFEFE,&H00002EFF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.2,0,2,23,23,383,1Style: Main-207-,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00002EFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,180,180,27,1Style: Thoughts-207-,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.4,3.8,2,180,180,27,1Style: Flashbacks-207-,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,180,180,27,1Style: Captions-207-,Chinacat,101,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,5,0,1,3.5,0,2,16,16,27,1Style: Note-207-,Impress BT Pace,57,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H96000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.75,3.75,8,180,180,27,1Style: Secondary-207-,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00D6D6D6,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,180,180,27,1Style: Karaoke,Duality,68,&H00292CC7,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,4,0,1,6.8,0,8,23,23,23,1Style: Kanji,Duality,68,&H00292CC7,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,4,0,1,6.8,0,8,23,23,146,1Style: Kanji-furigana,Duality,60,&H00292CC7,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.375,0,8,23,23,225,1Style: Translation,Duality,68,&H00292CC7,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,4,0,1,6.8,0,2,23,23,34,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 50,0:01:54.94,0:02:00.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guys! Someday, I will go to Elbaf! To the village of warriors!Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.43,0:02:01.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Okay!Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.33,0:02:06.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,♪ Gi-Gi-Giants! Gia-Giants! ♪Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.26,0:02:10.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,♪ Elbaf-baf! Elbaf-baf! ♪Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.10,0:02:13.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,♪ Everyone's huge 'cause they're giants! ♪Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.95,0:02:17.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,♪ They're huge! They're huge!  They're huge! ♪Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.50,0:02:19.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They sure are lively today...Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.40,0:02:29.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, I'm pretty worn out  after all that's happened...Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.65,0:02:33.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi. Could you keep an eye on the needle for me?Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.67,0:02:34.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure.Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.04,0:02:43.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now you can finally... return to Arabasta.Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.26,0:02:48.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That is, assuming we can  avoid trouble along the way.Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.94,0:02:52.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes. It's time I returned!Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.01,0:02:54.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After all, I am...Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.86,0:02:58.32,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,...the only one who can  save the kingdom, Princess!Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.32,0:03:03.57,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,The king—your father—no longer holds sway over his people.Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.57,0:03:07.74,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Our only hope to stem the tide of rebellion is for the countryDialogue: 50,0:03:07.74,0:03:10.29,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,to hear the truth directly from you.Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.05,0:03:14.33,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,So, no matter the cost, you must not die!Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.33,0:03:17.59,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,If it means you survive, then sacrifice those closest to youDialogue: 50,0:03:17.59,0:03:19.70,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,or betray them to your enemies!Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.70,0:03:21.13,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It will be agony!Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.90,0:03:25.60,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi! Are you resolved to stay alive?Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.63,0:03:31.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will stay alive and return to Arabasta.Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.46,0:03:42.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No need to push yourself so hard, Vivi-chan.Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.10,0:03:44.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have me!Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.36,0:03:49.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Today's sweets will put you right at ease. Petit fours?Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.86,0:03:52.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And to drink, would you like coffee or tea?Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.58,0:03:54.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji-san!Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.51,0:04:00.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yours is in the kitchen!Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.92,0:04:03.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Alright! – Alright!Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.99,0:04:05.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I got there first!Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.30,0:04:07.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,2,603...Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.60,0:04:09.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,2,604...Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.83,0:04:11.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,2,605...Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.33,0:04:14.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,2,606...!Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.04,0:04:21.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If only I'd been able to cut through that wax...Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.73,0:04:25.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we would've escaped so much sooner.Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.13,0:04:29.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm weak...Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.91,0:04:33.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I need to get stronger...Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.42,0:04:38.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and get to where I can cut through stuff like that with ease!Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.22,0:04:51.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 2 Bon Kurei! The Swanda is ready to set sail!Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.21,0:04:56.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay! Dial it down a notch!Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.27,0:05:00.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Honestly! What does any of this have to do with me?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.21,0:05:03.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 3 is a waste of space! You guys go finish him off!Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.46,0:05:04.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,W-We can't!Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.82,0:05:07.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even all of us together wouldn't stand a chance!Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.53,0:05:09.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,P-Please! It's the boss' orders!Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.24,0:05:12.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Un, deux, trois...Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.35,0:05:15.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's "four" again?Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.33,0:05:17.96,Note-207-,,0,0,0,,"Bon Kurei"Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.28,0:05:21.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zero-chan is so high maintenance.Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.42,0:05:30.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi. Sorry. I think I'm gonna...Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.74,0:05:39.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,go lie down.Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.30,0:05:42.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No problem, Nami-san!Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.79,0:05:44.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll keep an eye on our heading.Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.62,0:05:46.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should get some rest.Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.31,0:05:53.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.94,0:05:55.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone, come here! It's urgent!Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.57,0:05:59.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's up, Vivi?Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.47,0:06:01.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami-san has a terrible fever!Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.13,0:06:03.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Say what?! Nami-san has a what?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.81,0:06:24.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is Nami-san gonna die? Is she, Vivi-chan?Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.38,0:06:35.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's most likely the climate.Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.24,0:06:39.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Illness caused by abnormal weather is a well-known obstacleDialogue: 50,0:06:39.21,0:06:40.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for those new to the Grand Line.Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.63,0:06:48.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There are countless stories of the toughest, most infamous piratesDialogue: 50,0:06:48.10,0:06:49.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,suddenly dying from it.Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.35,0:06:53.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If left untreated, even the slightest chill can be fatal.Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.81,0:06:57.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami-san!Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.69,0:07:01.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does someone on the ship have any kind of medical training?Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.20,0:07:11.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, she'll feel better once she eats some meat! Right, Sanji?Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.23,0:07:16.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Y'know, I can think of a few meals meant to nurse sick people.Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.11,0:07:20.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But nursing's outside my expertise, so there's no telling if it would help.Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.03,0:07:23.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even so, I put a hundred times more careDialogue: 50,0:07:23.98,0:07:28.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,into Nami-san and Vivi-chan's meals than I do yours.Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.39,0:07:33.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To balance their diet, I only serve them fresh meat and vegetables.Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.23,0:07:36.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I give all the rotting stuff... to you guys.Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.26,0:07:37.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, now!Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.21,0:07:39.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It tastes great, though!Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.85,0:07:44.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My point is, as long as I'm this ship's cook,Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.49,0:07:48.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will always guarantee you get a balanced diet.Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.19,0:07:53.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But sick people require specific meals.Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.76,0:07:56.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What does she need, and for which symptoms?Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.27,0:07:58.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't make that call.Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.62,0:08:01.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then feed her everything!Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.29,0:08:05.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Going overboard like that is bound to make her sicker!Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.28,0:08:10.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I-It's at 40 degrees?! Her fever's gone up!Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.77,0:08:13.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There're doctors in Arabasta, right?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.66,0:08:15.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How long till we arrive, Vivi?Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.53,0:08:20.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A week maybe, but it might be too late by then.Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.65,0:08:22.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is being sick that bad?Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.69,0:08:25.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dunno. Never been sick.Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.40,0:08:28.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who in the world are you guys?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.77,0:08:30.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course it's bad!Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.25,0:08:33.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fevers of 40 degrees don't happen every day!Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.74,0:08:37.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Her life may very well be at stake.Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.41,0:08:44.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Nami's gonna die?! – Don't die, Nami-san!Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.10,0:08:45.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Settle down! Be quiet!Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.88,0:08:49.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's find a doctor to help Nami!Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.18,0:08:52.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay! Just calm down!Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.06,0:08:53.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll make her worse!Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.60,0:08:54.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No...Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.60,0:08:58.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No...Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.01,0:09:01.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami-san?Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.11,0:09:02.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh! She's all better!Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.77,0:09:03.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get real!Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.57,0:09:09.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In my desk drawer... there's a newspaper.Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.64,0:09:17.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No change in course.Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.19,0:09:20.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,N-No!Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.12,0:09:21.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This can't be!Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.99,0:09:24.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey. What is it?Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.00,0:09:26.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is it about Arabasta, Vivi-chan?Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.96,0:09:31.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My kingdom just saw 300,000 royal soldiers defect to the Rebellion.Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.13,0:09:37.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It all started as a cold warDialogue: 50,0:09:37.58,0:09:41.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with 600,000 royal soldiers deterring the 400,000 rebels.Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.34,0:09:43.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But this changes everything!Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.02,0:09:49.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The tensions in Arabasta are only going to intensify from here on.Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.53,0:09:51.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That paper's from three days ago.Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.50,0:09:56.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...  We can only go so fast.Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.89,0:09:59.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought if you saw this you'd only worry...Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.83,0:10:01.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Understand, Luffy?Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.92,0:10:05.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Things look pretty bad!Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.18,0:10:07.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whew, you got the gist of it.Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.14,0:10:09.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But you still need to see a doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.92,0:10:12.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. That thermometer must be broken.Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.84,0:10:15.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nobody gets a temperature of 40 degrees.Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.09,0:10:18.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's most likely sunstroke.Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.53,0:10:21.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't need a doctor. I'll get better on my own.Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.11,0:10:25.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For now, let's head straight for Arabasta as planned!Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.49,0:10:29.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks for worrying about me.Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.85,0:10:37.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh! She's better now?Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.45,0:10:39.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid. It's just a front.Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.94,0:10:54.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At this rate, blood will flow through the kingdom's streets.Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.79,0:10:55.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It'll be an all-out war.Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.44,0:11:00.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I don't prevent that, the kingdom of Arabasta will be finished.Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.57,0:11:03.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile will take over!Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.48,0:11:07.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not enough... to simply get back alive!Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.77,0:11:09.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I must expedite my return!Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.27,0:11:14.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A moment wasted means a million citizens will senselessly kill each other!Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.92,0:11:17.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's a million people?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.53,0:11:20.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What an immense burden you're carrying, Vivi-chan.Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.88,0:11:37.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon! Were you even paying attention up here?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.84,0:11:40.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whadya mean? The ship's going straight.Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.83,0:11:42.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, straight at a right angle!Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.42,0:11:45.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You need to watch the needle!Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.24,0:11:48.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why bother? I was watching that big cloud there.Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.93,0:11:51.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Clouds move and change shape!Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.12,0:11:54.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, my head's killing me.Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.45,0:11:57.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So then leave this to me and go to bed!Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.07,0:12:00.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm here because I can't leave this to you!Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.07,0:12:03.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The air's different.Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.82,0:12:07.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The air? The weather's been nice this whole time.Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.09,0:12:09.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Forget it! Just get the others!Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.29,0:12:12.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Get out here, you guys! We've got work to do!Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.69,0:12:14.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.28,0:12:19.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hard to feel motivated when it's you giving the orders.Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.68,0:12:21.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and move!Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.32,0:12:23.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hoist the sails and catch the wind aport!Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.01,0:12:25.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everything okay, Nami-san?Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.76,0:12:27.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The waves are quiet, and the weather's nice.Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.48,0:12:30.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The wind...Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.66,0:12:32.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The wind?Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.69,0:12:36.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The wind is picking up and heading directly toward us.Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.45,0:12:37.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think th–Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.90,0:12:38.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.79,0:12:40.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hot!Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.69,0:12:43.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're burning up! Yeah, stay inside until we find a doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.82,0:12:45.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mind your own business!Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.52,0:12:47.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is my normal temperature!Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.34,0:12:49.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quit being dumb and man the ropes!Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.08,0:12:50.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami-san.Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.50,0:12:55.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I get that this is for Vivi-chan's sake, but if you overdo it...Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.84,0:12:57.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I told you, I'm fine!Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.92,0:13:05.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Nami! You really ought to–Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.51,0:13:07.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just hurry it up and turn the ship!Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.59,0:13:16.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.67,0:13:19.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,what could it be?Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.91,0:13:22.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is a bit different from a storm.Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.77,0:13:52.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I need to hurry... back to Arabasta.Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.78,0:13:58.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone, I need a favor!Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.07,0:14:04.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As a passenger on your ship, I know I have no right to ask this,Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.01,0:14:07.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but my homeland is  on the brink of disaster.Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.40,0:14:09.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So we need to expedite our trip!Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.49,0:14:11.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't waste even a single minute!Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.61,0:14:15.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must take me to Arabasta at this ship's top speed!Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.56,0:14:20.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course! That's what we promised!Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.88,0:14:27.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So let's find an island with a doctor right away!Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.59,0:14:32.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The sooner we cure Nami-san, the sooner we get to Arabasta!Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.73,0:14:35.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's this ship's top speed, right?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.95,0:14:38.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! We can't go any faster than that!Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.31,0:14:40.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.57,0:14:44.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't a princess be more worried about her one million citizens?Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.31,0:14:48.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're right! All the more reason to hurry and cure Nami-san!Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.63,0:14:51.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well said, Vivi-chan!Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.41,0:14:52.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've fallen for you all over again!Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.66,0:14:54.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've got spirit.Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.74,0:14:57.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks...Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.26,0:14:59.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't overexert yourself, Nami-san!Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.83,0:15:06.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Vivi. Y'know...Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.06,0:15:07.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I might be... in trouble.Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.41,0:15:08.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami-san! Hang in there!Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.10,0:15:10.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.69,0:15:14.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a cyclone!Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.30,0:15:15.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's huge!Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.22,0:15:18.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,W-Wait! That's the direction–Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.38,0:15:21.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the direction our ship was just going!Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.36,0:15:24.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We would've hit it head-on had we kept our original heading!Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.78,0:15:37.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yikes! We just barely missed it!Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.06,0:15:39.22,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Incredible!Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.22,0:15:43.08,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Grand Line cyclones are said to be impossible to predict!Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.08,0:15:44.04,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Yet, she...Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.12,0:15:48.47,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,She doesn't predict weather based on prevailing theory.Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.47,0:15:51.51,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,It's almost as if she's detecting the weather with her body!Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.51,0:15:54.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This navigator is one of a kind!Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.32,0:15:57.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright! Let's hurry, then!Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.50,0:16:00.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go find us a doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.57,0:16:01.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.50,0:16:24.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do we do, Vivi-chan?! Nami-san's fever won't break!Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.52,0:16:27.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji-san! Karoo! I asked you to stop freaking out!Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.42,0:16:36.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See any doctors?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.03,0:16:37.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You actually expect him to, moron?Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.11,0:16:45.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys. Ever heard of people who could stand on the ocean?Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.27,0:16:47.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can people stand on the ocean?Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.87,0:16:50.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Zoro. Is this some kind of riddle?Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.95,0:16:53.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then... what's that?Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.57,0:16:55.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's what?Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.27,0:16:56.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.55,0:17:20.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hi. It sure is chilly today.Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.02,0:17:23.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! It is chilly today!Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.31,0:17:26.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah! Chilly, chilly! Today's very chilly!Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.47,0:17:28.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really?Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.03,0:17:34.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Increase buoyancy!Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.28,0:17:35.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.94,0:17:43.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that?! A watermelon?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.62,0:17:45.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are we shaking?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.16,0:17:49.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Steady the rudder! If anything happens to Nami, I'll gut you all!Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.67,0:17:57.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This thing can't actually be... a ship?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.28,0:18:22.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crap! A p-pirate ship!Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.34,0:18:24.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,S-So cool!Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.17,0:18:27.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just when we're in a hurry...Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.27,0:18:36.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Surprised?! It's our jumbo submersible raid ship, the Bliking!Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.89,0:18:42.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi-chan! Take over!Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.76,0:18:43.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.77,0:18:46.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! What's going on?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.25,0:19:02.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So? What's going on?Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.25,0:19:05.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The ship's under attack.Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.39,0:19:15.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I had figured as much from the looks of things.Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.30,0:19:21.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you really pirates? This can't be right.Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.93,0:19:24.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is it just the four of you?Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.55,0:19:28.46,Main-207-,,0,0,10,,I find it hard to believe...Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.46,0:19:31.31,Main-207-,,0,0,10,,that a pirate group would only have four people.Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.60,0:19:38.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is that guy?! He even ate the knife!Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.62,0:19:42.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just watching hurts!Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.94,0:19:46.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, no matter. First, a question for you.Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.48,0:19:50.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We want to go to the Kingdom of Drum.Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.67,0:19:53.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you happen to have an eternal pose or a log pose?Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.65,0:19:59.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nope. Never even heard of the place.Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.17,0:20:02.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, if that's everything, then get outta here!Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.23,0:20:03.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're in a hurry!Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.86,0:20:06.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to mess with you!Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.49,0:20:10.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't rush life like that.Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.45,0:20:12.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you don't have either one, oh well.Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.38,0:20:15.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll take your treasure and your ship.Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.15,0:20:16.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.02,0:20:19.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But first, I'm feeling a bit hungry!Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.78,0:20:26.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is this guy?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.70,0:20:28.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get your mouth off our ship!Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.50,0:20:29.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.58,0:20:31.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The great Wapol is currently eating!Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.60,0:20:32.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.41,0:20:35.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn that bastard! Fire!Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.66,0:20:39.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Should've done that from the start.Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.59,0:20:41.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh? We can have at 'em?Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.80,0:20:43.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, wait! We can discuss this!Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.68,0:20:52.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look what they started.Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.39,0:20:54.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're clueless! Rushing to their deaths!Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.69,0:20:55.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gunfire?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.42,0:20:59.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Karoo! Watch Nami-san! I'll be right back!Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.34,0:21:04.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't bite off more than you can chew!Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.82,0:21:05.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Réception!Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.15,0:21:31.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All bark and no bite.Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.32,0:21:33.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,W-Wapol, my liege! These guys are...!Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.44,0:21:37.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop eating my ship!Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.67,0:21:39.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Say, this ship doesn't taste half bad.Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.59,0:21:40.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.57,0:21:42.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fool! You're no match for the great Wapol!Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.80,0:21:45.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His Munch-Munch Fruit power will eat you whole!Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.45,0:21:46.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.71,0:21:49.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.26,0:21:52.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Vivi-chan. Everything fine with Nami-san?Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.96,0:21:53.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.24,0:21:59.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This guy's hard to chew on!Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.63,0:22:02.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why, you!Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.71,0:22:05.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go flying!Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.64,0:22:11.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wapol-sama?Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.98,0:22:17.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is really bad! He sent the great Wapol flying!Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.31,0:22:21.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is a disaster! The great Wapol isn't able to swim!Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.57,0:22:28.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He will surely drown and perish in the sea if he sinks before we can retrieve him!Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.03,0:22:30.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't over, you!Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.64,0:22:32.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll make you pay for this!Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.45,0:22:34.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Remember us!Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.54,0:22:36.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay!Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.56,0:22:41.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, remember us! Please!Dialogue: 50,0:22:45.60,0:22:49.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,J-Just now, what was all that?Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.35,0:22:51.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, I guess his name is Wapol?Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.66,0:22:54.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter. Don't sweat it.Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.37,0:22:56.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's a moron.Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.02,0:22:57.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's just forget about him.Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.25,0:23:08.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where have I seen him before?Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.79,0:23:22.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Will her fever go down if we dump water on her?Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.45,0:23:23.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You dumbass!Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.46,0:23:27.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't good. The sun's about to set for today, Vivi-chan.Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.46,0:23:29.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes... You're right.Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.28,0:23:31.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's drop anchor somewhere.Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.67,0:23:35.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't sail at night without Nami-san's navigation.Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.01,0:23:36.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,True.Dialogue: 50,0:24:05.90,0:24:07.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Brr, it's cold.Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.95,0:24:14.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Almost a full moon, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.78,0:24:30.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Brr! Oh, crap, I fell asleep!Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.27,0:24:32.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're up early, Usopp!Dialogue: 50,0:24:32.99,0:24:35.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't just sit around doing nothing!Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.20,0:24:38.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We gotta get out of this jam as quickly as possible!Dialogue: 50,0:24:38.93,0:24:41.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Good point.Dialogue: 50,0:24:48.13,0:24:52.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Say, isn't this area unusually calm and cold?Dialogue: 50,0:24:53.33,0:24:56.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sudden, strange calms...Dialogue: 50,0:24:56.57,0:25:00.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess that's another erratic quirk of the Grand Line.Dialogue: 50,0:25:00.97,0:25:03.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's not necessarily the case.Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.69,0:25:06.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,More likely, it's proof that an island is nearby.Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.15,0:25:08.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji-san! Can you carefully scan the horizon?Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.36,0:25:10.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi-chan?Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.63,0:25:14.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A winter island is nearby. I'm certain of it.Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.27,0:25:15.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Winter island? – Ow!Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.12,0:25:20.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Climate-wise, the Grand Line has four basic island types:Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.76,0:25:26.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Summer isles, spring isles, autumn isles, and winter isles.Dialogue: 50,0:25:26.15,0:25:29.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In addition, each one generally has four seasons of its own.Dialogue: 50,0:25:30.30,0:25:35.06,Main-207-,,0,0,5,,On the Grand Line, you contend with no fewer than sixteen seasons.Dialogue: 50,0:25:35.06,0:25:40.68,Main-207-,,0,0,5,,There are summer island summers and even winter island winters.Dialogue: 50,0:25:41.91,0:25:47.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course, there are many exceptions and unknown climates.Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.06,0:25:48.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I get it.Dialogue: 50,0:25:48.52,0:25:52.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line consists of strings of various islands,Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.17,0:25:56.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and weather is adversely affected on the seas between them.Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.48,0:25:57.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.66,0:26:03.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So when the weather stabilizes, you're near an island.Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.83,0:26:06.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're right! There it is!Dialogue: 50,0:26:09.99,0:26:12.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We found an island!Dialogue: 50,0:26:14.35,0:26:15.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,An island?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:15.93,0:26:18.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh! An island! We found an island!Dialogue: 50,0:26:18.38,0:26:22.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami! Great news! It's an island! You'll get better!Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.64,0:26:25.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's an island! An island! Island!Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.13,0:26:31.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Island! Island! Island! Island!Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.08,0:26:33.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just go look already. I'll watch her.Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.08,0:26:33.16,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Island! Island!Dialogue: 50,0:26:38.28,0:26:40.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,An island!Dialogue: 50,0:26:41.12,0:26:45.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,White! So white! Has to be snow! A snow island, huh?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:45.12,0:26:49.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy! Just remember, this isn't the time for adventure!Dialogue: 50,0:26:49.44,0:26:51.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a quick stop to find a doctor.Dialogue: 50,0:26:51.29,0:26:53.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once Nami-san's looked at, we're gone!Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.81,0:26:55.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:26:56.16,0:26:59.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Snow is so nice and white!Dialogue: 50,0:26:59.85,0:27:01.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's no use. He's not listening.Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.44,0:27:04.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,H-H-Hold on! Is this a good idea?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:04.06,0:27:07.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If there's snow, won't there also be snow monsters?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:07.15,0:27:10.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And we don't know if people live there! Oh, no!Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.06,0:27:12.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My chronic can't-get-on-this-island disease!Dialogue: 50,0:27:12.44,0:27:16.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Snow! I love snow! It's white!Dialogue: 50,0:27:16.24,0:27:18.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll prep us for landfall.Dialogue: 50,0:27:46.48,0:27:49.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All this snow! It's pure happiness!Dialogue: 50,0:27:50.51,0:27:53.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is really something. What's with those mountains?Dialogue: 50,0:27:54.41,0:27:57.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Say, Luffy. Aren't you cold, dressed like that?Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.83,0:28:00.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's minus 10 degrees right now!Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.21,0:28:02.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's when bears get ready to hibernate!Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.87,0:28:04.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh.Dialogue: 50,0:28:05.73,0:28:06.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So cold!Dialogue: 50,0:28:06.58,0:28:08.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Took you long enough!Dialogue: 50,0:28:13.21,0:28:15.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a waterfall of melted snow.Dialogue: 50,0:28:15.80,0:28:17.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We may be able to dock here.Dialogue: 50,0:28:18.34,0:28:21.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, who's going doctor hunting?Dialogue: 50,0:28:21.69,0:28:22.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Actually, you see any people?Dialogue: 50,0:28:23.54,0:28:24.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm going!Dialogue: 50,0:28:24.30,0:28:25.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So am I!Dialogue: 50,0:28:25.22,0:28:26.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay! Have fun!Dialogue: 50,0:28:26.60,0:28:28.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's far enough, pirates!Dialogue: 50,0:28:43.78,0:28:46.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey. I found people.Dialogue: 50,0:28:46.29,0:28:49.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... they don't seem too friendly.Dialogue: 50,0:28:51.18,0:28:53.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Attention, pirates!Dialogue: 50,0:28:53.16,0:28:56.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Turn around and leave this place! This instant!Dialogue: 50,0:28:56.50,0:28:58.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We came to find a doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:28:58.98,0:29:00.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's a sick person on board!Dialogue: 50,0:29:00.21,0:29:03.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's a dirty trick, you pirate bastards!Dialogue: 50,0:29:04.07,0:29:08.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,On our island, any and all pirates are barred entry!Dialogue: 50,0:29:08.42,0:29:12.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Raise anchor and leave, or we blow your ship to smithereens!Dialogue: 50,0:29:14.32,0:29:17.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They really hate our guts. And we've only just met.Dialogue: 50,0:29:17.81,0:29:19.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Less talking!Dialogue: 50,0:29:19.44,0:29:20.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're shooting!Dialogue: 50,0:29:20.19,0:29:21.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You did not just do that!Dialogue: 50,0:29:21.90,0:29:23.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– No, Sanji-san! – Bastard!Dialogue: 50,0:29:34.45,0:29:35.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi!Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 1,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Gigglebot NinjaDialogue: 1,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Gigglebot NinjaDialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,TimingDialogue: 1,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,TimingDialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,PhosCity DraSleekDialogue: 1,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,PhosCity DraSleekDialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:09.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 1,0:00:05.73,0:00:09.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:09.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000 PepperjackDialogue: 1,0:00:05.73,0:00:09.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000 PepperjackDialogue: 0,0:00:09.73,0:00:11.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,SoundtrackingDialogue: 1,0:00:09.73,0:00:11.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,SoundtrackingDialogue: 0,0:00:09.73,0:00:11.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,HaleeDialogue: 1,0:00:09.73,0:00:11.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,HaleeDialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:13.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 1,0:00:11.73,0:00:13.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:13.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 1,0:00:11.73,0:00:13.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:00:13.73,0:00:15.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 1,0:00:13.73,0:00:15.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 0,0:00:13.73,0:00:15.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 1,0:00:13.73,0:00:15.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:15.73,0:00:17.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Subtitle EditingDialogue: 1,0:00:15.73,0:00:17.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Subtitle EditingDialogue: 0,0:00:15.73,0:00:17.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,ZenefDialogue: 1,0: